``` Replay / linkability attack (tracking one person)
    The same subscriber gets SYNCH_FAILURE again and again, because an
    attacker keeps replaying an old challenge to check if that phone is
    nearby. Normal phones get SYNCH_FAILURE once, resync and log in,
    so we count per person to keep the noise out.
    Threshold: 3 per subscriber per 10 minutes. ```
index=fiveg source="traffic.jsonl" event_type=auth_failure cause=SYNCH_FAILURE
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count values(cell) as cells by _time subscriber
| where count >= 3
